<span id="S6.T4.2.7.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Scales via cloud-based multi-agent orchestration</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S6.T4.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S6.T4.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
<span id="S6.T4.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:85.4pt;">
<span id="S6.T4.2.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.T4.2.8.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Innovation Points vs. Others</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S6.T4.2.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
<span id="S6.T4.2.8.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.8pt;">
<span id="S6.T4.2.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">User-centered, explainable swarm evolution; bidirectional (forward/backward) learning loop</span>
</span></td>
